interprets it as a major apotropaic symbol in Bronze Age Aegean iconography.", 
"document_ref": "d5", "source_ref": "s5", "qualifiers": ["interpretation_type: 
iconographic_reinterpretation"], "limitations": [], "confidence": "medium"},
    {"local_ref": "st19", "text": "Vlachopoulos argues that recognizing the 
