  - The description line: “A glimpse into the Minoan after-world, and a 
sepulchral treasure of gold signet-rings and bead-seals from Thisbê, Boeotia, by
Sir Arthur Evans.”  
  - The catalog provides links to digitized copies (depending on institutional 
access), which would allow reading Evans’ full discussion of the treasure, the 
ring, and any remarks on acquisition or findspot.

