  - Important for assessing whether modern scholarship explicitly connects any 
of the Griffin Warrior rings to the “Ring of Nestor,” or whether parallels are 
purely comparative.  
  - The article’s title (“Lord of the Gold Rings”) and focus on Pylos rings have
encouraged popular and media parallels with Evans’ “Ring of Nestor”; checking 
this article helps determine if the association is interpretive rather than a 
provenance claim.

- **Body / key details (from abstract and page-level information):**  
  - Abstract:  
